# Godot must not look inside this folder.
#
# art/fonts/ holds the untrimmed upstream Noto Sans SC (10.6 MB, 30,890 characters). It is
# the source the shipped subset is cut from by tools/subset_font.py, not an asset the game
# loads: `assets/fonts/NotoSansSC-Regular.ttf` is the 330 KB subset the theme points at.
# Next to it is the untrimmed upstream Noto Serif SC Regular (11.1 MB), the source of
# `assets/fonts/NotoSerifSC-Regular.otf`, the subset the dialogue panel sets its text in.
#
# Godot imports every `.ttf` under res:// as a FontFile and packs every imported resource
# into the export, so leaving the full font next to the subset would have put 10.6 MB of
# unused glyphs into every build — the reason this folder exists. Same arrangement as
# art/props/ for the .blend sources (docs/ASSET_PIPELINE.md §5).
